I traced Paseo's delegation path from source to understand why subagent types (`explore`, `coder`, `web`, `inventory`) don't appear in the UI. Root cause: `mapping.js:31` filters `agent.mode !== "subagent"` from the display layer, but `agent.js:61` passes `settings.modeId` straight through to `session.switchAgent({agent})` unvalidated — so `create_agent` with `modeId:"explore"` works today, just undiscoverable.

