Investigated whether `permission.task: "deny"` (or equivalent config) can fully remove the `task` tool from the model-visible schema, not just block its execution. Spawned a Paseo research agent on `opencode-go/beam-free` to check the published config schema, docs, and source of `anomalyco/opencode`. The agent errored with 403 RegionError (geo-blocked), so I relaunched on `opencode/glm-5.3-flash-free`.

