I proposed switching from the shorthand `"task": "deny"` to `"tools": {"task": false}` (a different deny-rule producer at `prompt.ts:1060-1066`, explicitly `pattern:"*"`). User approved, I edited `~/.config/opencode/opencode.jsonc`, user restarted.

